    "text": "A point charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math> is placed at a distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;from the centre of a conducting shell of inner radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></math> and outer radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi></math>. The electric potential at the centre of the shell will be"
