  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The induced charges will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> as shown in the figure.</p><p>The potential at the centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mtext>q</mtext><mtext>R</mtext></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mtext>q</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>q</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>πε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>q</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0010_5bf885ec7ad8.jpg\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 164px;\" /></p>"
